WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.815
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online Grammar, level B two.

2
00:00:06.115 --> 00:00:09.199
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.499 --> 00:00:15.402
Unit twelve: Emphasis with Do/Does/Did. Today you will make a statement stronger with an auxiliary.

4
00:00:15.702 --> 00:00:18.331
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:22.441
Part one: words. You will learn eight new words.

6
00:00:23.283 --> 00:00:23.948
Do.

7
00:00:24.950 --> 00:00:27.646
Do means used for emphatic present statements.

8
00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.344
I do like it.

9
00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:32.335
Your turn. Say: Do.

10
00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:35.830
Do.

11
00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:37.399
Does.

12
00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:40.905
Does means emphatic form for he, she, it.

13
00:00:41.517 --> 00:00:42.773
She does know.

14
00:00:43.383 --> 00:00:45.966
Your turn. Say: Does.

15
00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:49.569
Does.

16
00:00:50.317 --> 00:00:50.923
Did.

17
00:00:51.917 --> 00:00:53.963
Did means emphatic past form.

18
00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:55.632
I did tell you.

19
00:00:56.217 --> 00:00:58.846
Your turn. Say: Did.

20
00:01:01.700 --> 00:01:02.388
Did.

21
00:01:03.150 --> 00:01:04.139
Emphatic.

22
00:01:05.150 --> 00:01:08.032
Emphatic means expressing strong feeling.

23
00:01:08.617 --> 00:01:10.105
An emphatic reply.

24
00:01:10.717 --> 00:01:13.508
Your turn. Say: Emphatic.

25
00:01:16.367 --> 00:01:17.437
Emphatic.

26
00:01:18.183 --> 00:01:19.393
Stress.

27
00:01:20.383 --> 00:01:22.789
Stress means extra force on a word.

28
00:01:23.383 --> 00:01:24.779
Put stress on do.

29
00:01:25.383 --> 00:01:28.221
Your turn. Say: Stress.

30
00:01:31.067 --> 00:01:31.940
Stress.

31
00:01:32.683 --> 00:01:33.859
Contradiction.

32
00:01:34.850 --> 00:01:37.093
Contradiction means saying the opposite.

33
00:01:37.683 --> 00:01:39.427
A polite contradiction.

34
00:01:40.017 --> 00:01:42.855
Your turn. Say: Contradiction.

35
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:46.933
Contradiction.

36
00:01:47.683 --> 00:01:48.835
Affirmation.

37
00:01:49.850 --> 00:01:53.022
Affirmation means a strong statement that something is true.

38
00:01:53.617 --> 00:01:54.873
An affirmation.

39
00:01:55.483 --> 00:01:57.915
Your turn. Say: Affirmation.

40
00:02:00.767 --> 00:02:01.849
Affirmation.

41
00:02:02.583 --> 00:02:03.712
I do like it.

42
00:02:04.717 --> 00:02:07.111
I do like it means an emphatic positive.

43
00:02:07.717 --> 00:02:08.950
I do like it!

44
00:02:09.550 --> 00:02:12.597
Your turn. Say: I do like it.

45
00:02:15.433 --> 00:02:16.760
I do like it.

46
00:02:17.567 --> 00:02:21.426
Part two: dialogue. Let's listen to a conversation.

47
00:02:22.283 --> 00:02:26.642
Visal, someone says you don't like the food. How do you disagree?

48
00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:38.509
I do like it! In a positive sentence we add do, does or did before the base verb and stress it. This makes the statement emphatic.

49
00:02:39.617 --> 00:02:40.757
When do we use it?

50
00:02:41.850 --> 00:02:56.886
To contradict: You didn't call me. I did call you! To insist: She does work hard. To express a strong feeling: I do appreciate your help. Stress is placed on the auxiliary.

51
00:02:57.983 --> 00:02:59.286
How is it formed?

52
00:03:00.383 --> 00:03:16.459
Do / does / did + base verb: I do enjoy it, he does look tired, they did arrive. With be or modals we just stress the verb: I AM happy. The emphatic do is not for every sentence; too much sounds unnatural.

53
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:19.147
Part three: grammar.

54
00:03:19.983 --> 00:03:23.980
Grammar focus: Emphatic do and does and did plus base verb.

55
00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:25.478
Look at the pattern.

56
00:03:26.183 --> 00:03:27.301
I do like it!

57
00:03:28.217 --> 00:03:29.601
She does work hard.

58
00:03:30.517 --> 00:03:31.971
I did call you!

59
00:03:32.933 --> 00:03:40.357
Add do / does / did + base verb and stress it to contradict, insist or show strong feeling. With be and modals, just stress the verb.

60
00:03:41.117 --> 00:03:44.396
Be careful! Don't say: I did called you.

61
00:03:46.333 --> 00:03:47.927
Say: I did call you.

62
00:03:48.227 --> 00:03:50.156
Use the base verb after did.

63
00:03:50.967 --> 00:03:53.317
Part four: reading. Read and listen.

64
00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.401
I Really Do.

65
00:03:55.701 --> 00:03:58.165
You think I did not call you, but I did call you.

66
00:03:59.167 --> 00:04:02.153
She does work hard, even if it does not look like it.

67
00:04:03.167 --> 00:04:04.841
I do appreciate your help.

68
00:04:05.833 --> 00:04:08.820
They did arrive on time; the train was late.

69
00:04:09.833 --> 00:04:12.088
The contradiction was polite but clear.

70
00:04:13.200 --> 00:04:17.074
Part five: quiz. Five questions. Are you ready?

71
00:04:17.917 --> 00:04:20.560
'You didn't call.' 'I blank call you!'

72
00:04:20.860 --> 00:04:23.840
A, did. B, do. C, does.

73
00:04:27.400 --> 00:04:29.330
The answer is A: did.

74
00:04:30.483 --> 00:04:32.576
He blank work hard, believe me.

75
00:04:32.876 --> 00:04:36.239
A, do. B, does. C, did.

76
00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.741
The answer is B: does.

77
00:04:42.883 --> 00:04:44.697
Which sentence is emphatic?

78
00:04:44.997 --> 00:04:48.755
A, I like it.. B, I do like it.. C, I don't like it..

79
00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:54.787
The answer is B: I do like it..

80
00:04:55.950 --> 00:04:57.148
Which is correct?

81
00:04:57.448 --> 00:05:02.112
A, I did called you.. B, I did call you.. C, I do called you..

82
00:05:05.667 --> 00:05:08.096
The answer is B: I did call you..

83
00:05:09.250 --> 00:05:11.400
According to the reading, what was late?

84
00:05:11.700 --> 00:05:15.319
A, the train. B, the bus. C, the plane.

85
00:05:18.867 --> 00:05:21.191
The answer is A: the train.

86
00:05:22.400 --> 00:05:25.389
Part six: speaking. It's your turn to talk.

87
00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:29.608
Write an emphatic sentence using 'do' to contradict someone.

88
00:05:38.417 --> 00:05:39.963
Now listen to Visal.

89
00:05:40.263 --> 00:05:51.637
You say I never help, but I do help at home! I did wash the dishes yesterday, and I do clean my room every week. I use emphatic do and did to contradict politely.

90
00:05:51.937 --> 00:05:53.600
Excellent answer, Visal!

91
00:05:54.517 --> 00:05:59.758
Great work! Now you can use eight new words and emphatic do and does and did plus base verb.

92
00:06:00.058 --> 00:06:04.347
Today's value is truthfulness. Tell the truth and check the facts.

93
00:06:04.647 --> 00:06:07.427
See you in Unit thirteen. Goodbye!

94
00:06:07.727 --> 00:06:10.461
Thank you, Ms. Emma! Bye, everyone!

